<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian 63-day T-bills sell at average 11.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Nigerian 63-day T-bills sell at average 11.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigerian treasury bill sales at weekly auction on Friday as announced by the Central Bank:</p>
<p>    AUCTION DATE			Aug 15	 Aug 8</p>
<p>    TENOR				 63 days	56 days</p>
<p>    AMOUNT SOLD (million naira)   182	    4,692</p>
<p>    BIDS (million naira)	    182	    4,492</p>
<p>    WEIGHTED AVERAGE RATE	   11.8000	11.8034 pct</p>
<p>    TRUE YIELD			  12.0457	12.0175 pct</p>
<p>($1=81.9 naira)</p>
<p>--Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
